  <section class="individual bg-darkblue pb-3 pt-5" id="step2">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12">
          <div class="title-container">
            <img src="https://individualogist.com/soul-flame-tarot/assets/img/title-bg-v2.png" alt="Snow" style="width:100%;" class="long-title">
            <h3 class="centered">As A Magician, These Are Your <span class="text-orange">Hidden Strengths And<br>Positive Attributes</span> That You Wouldn't Expect</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-sm-4 order-sm-2">
              <img src="../assets/images/abilities-2.png" style="width: 100%;">
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-8">
              <p>As a Magician, you are introspective and always reflecting on how things are going around you. You refuse to see things only on a surface level and always try to find some deeper meaning in what you say or do.</p>
              <p>This insistence on profundity and even greater self-knowledge allow you to derive meaning in even the most mundane experiences. Each day isn’t just some tedious cycle in your life-- it’s a whole new experience filled with insight and newfound greater self-awareness.</p>
              <p>Such <span class="text-orange">capacity for self-reflection</span> translates into something much greater, too. The more your knowledge of yourself and everyone around you grows, the more refined your decisions become. This is because you ultimately end up being more considerate of other people’s traits, failures, and achievements, as well as your own.</p>
              <p>Magicians often have a high sense of self-worth, and you are no exception. This means that you are the sort of person who is able to resist abuse from anyone. You are able to read any subtle hints of personal degradation and are able to express your displeasure without reservation.</p>
              <p>This high sense of self-pride also means that you are acutely aware of and immensely responsible for your own choices. You are not the sort of person who deflects or evades blame when things go wrong; you own up to your failures and take them in stride.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>People will often mistake this attitude for being selfish or self-absorbed, but this couldn’t be further from the truth. You are just as capable of selflessness, and the fact that you have this trait means that you are a <span class="text-orange">person of integrity and authenticity</span>.</p>
          <p>As a Magician, you have a rational nature that naturally drives you to express your thoughts in a more refined fashion, as though you are literally turning pure cognitive ideas into tangible letters or spoken words.</p>
          <p>Such approach is something that naturally draws people to you. After all, being able to articulate your thoughts with clarity and precision is something that people are naturally drawn to. It projects power, strength and confidence, thus ensuring that you have a leading role where eloquence is most needed.</p>
          <p>Aside from its social aspect, <span class="text-orange">eloquence is also a highly sought ability</span> in terms of career. Many companies seek eloquent employees who are able to navigate an increasingly globalized world. With the power of words and your charisma at your disposal, your arguments will prove persuasive-- and your career will soar as a result.</p>
          <p>More importantly, Magicians are known to be very calm, and the way they justify this is through their discipline. In times of peace, you do not lower your guard. Instead, you use this time to productively preempt any eventualities that may head your way. You have one foot in the future, and your actions dictate it.</p>
          <p>However, your abilities truly start to shine when things go south. The more stressful things become, the more you actually double down on this particular strength. As a result, you end up <span class="text-orange">preserving your mental acuity</span>, allowing you to make pointed decisions without any drawbacks.</p>
          <p>This makes you an easy person to work with and your life even easier than most people would have it. With your calm judgment, people will naturally see you as a source of strength and a person worth emulating. You will easily stand as a guide for many others, and because you refuse to give up in the most heated of moments, you also end up being extremely efficient in life. This means no problem is too hard to solve on your end.</p>
          <p>Now that you’re acquainted with your strengths, dear <span class="username"></span>, it is time for you to know how you can exercise them in various aspects of your life. </p>
          <p>For now, let’s start with one that strikes a chord: your romantic relationships.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-12 text-center">
          <a class="btn btn-outline-success btn-2" id="nav-btn2" onclick="nextReading(2,3)">Show Me Now</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="individual text-left pb-3 pt-5" id="step3">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12">
          <div class="title-container">
            <img src="https://individualogist.com/soul-flame-tarot/assets/img/title-bg-v2.png" alt="Snow" style="width:100%;">
            <h3 class="centered">As A Magician, These Are Your <span class="text-orange">Relationship Qualities</span> That Are Within You</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-sm-4">
              <img src="../assets/images/relationship.png" style="width: 100%;">
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-8">
              <p>Due to your rational nature, you prefer like-minded, intellectual types. Whereas other archetypes tend to be whimsical and passionate, you are inclined to follow logic and imagination. </p>
              <p>When you are in a relationship, this tendency will bring rivalry. As such, your relationship may hinge on how well the other person can keep up with you in a debate, or even in a craft that you two share. By doing so, you can both expect to improve one another.</p>
              <p>Given this, you are likely to look at your relationship in terms of how far you can take each other. Are you learning something new together? Are you having new, fun experiences worth sharing?</p>
              <p>With these questions, what ends up happening is that you’re going to try and encourage your partner to be the best that they can possibly be. When they’re down, you’re likely to try and find a way to cheer them up, because just like a Magician, you too would like them to <span class="text-orange">subvert and challenge reality</span>.</p>
              <p>But while this can be encouraging, know that this can also be a weakness. After all, expecting your loved one to be the best at all times creates a burden on their part, to the point where the relationship can seem like a pretense.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>As a Magician, you need to make sure that you’re not just forcing someone to be the perfect partner. Rather, you should create <span class="text-orange">authentic experiences</span> that will lend weight to your vision while simultaneously catering to theirs.</p>
          <p>Thus, don’t focus only on the material and intellectual aspect of a relationship. Having someone who is your equal is a good thing, and it can be attractive early on, but if you want a relationship to last, you need to look beyond the intellectual aspect. Not everyone is going to be intelligent all the time because we’re all imperfect. Learn to embrace the imperfections and integrate them into your vision of a proper relationship.</p>
          <hr class="dashed">
          <p>Looking at the core qualities of your archetype, we’ll see a Magician who endlessly strives for uniqueness. If you could, you would scour the Earth looking for someone who’s just right for you.</p>
          <p>This trait often manifests in your likelihood of finding truly unique characters. You’ll often do your best to refuse to date anyone whom you think is generic, and you will <span class="text-orange">look for someone who has that spark</span>-- the same radiant power and drive you possess.</p>
          <p>At first, it may seem like arrogance on your part to want to shoot for the stars. But what many don’t understand is that this view on romance has its merits. Magicians seek those with the most compatibility to them so they do not experience pain or waste the other person’s time for that matter.</p>
          <p>Under the right conditions, this sort of relationship can be truly romantic. Much like peanut butter and jelly, the ideal relationship will consist of you two immediately clicking and finding the right stuff to have a long relationship.</p>
          <p>Of course, this only works if you are lucky. Since your standards can be quite high, it may take a while for you to properly establish a relationship. During this time, you may feel the <span class="text-orange">need for intimacy</span> or some way to release some of your pent up need for love. As such, you may think of engaging in trial-and-error along the way.</p>
          <p>As such, the loneliness that a Magician might face in the quest for a romance that satisfies their highest expectations can be rather crushing. Given this, if you must play the field, you should at least reflect on each failure before going onto the next one so your chances of finding the right one are close.</p>
          <p>As you know, however, the Magician is not just about romance and love. Indeed, there’s another aspect in your life where you can apply yourself, <span class="username"></span>.</p>
          <p>Without further ado, it’s time to see where you can take yourself in your career.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-12 text-center">
          <a class="btn btn-outline-success btn-3" id="nav-btn2" onclick="nextReading(3,4)">Show Me Now</a>
        </div>
